      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Southern Pacific Railroad donated Bishop’s 1883 depot, locomotive, and rail cars to the city in 1960, preserving a key piece of its rail history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
