      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bishop’s rugged backcountry has hosted dozens of western movies, from John Wayne’s classics to the 1990 thriller Tremors, drawing film crews for decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
